        "supports_or_contradicts": "Source 990 / DSMZ 1113 identifies Difco EMJH base, separate from 100 ml enrichment. The manufacturer approximate basal formula per litre lists disodium phosphate 1.0 g, monopotassium phosphate 0.3 g, sodium chloride 1.0 g, ammonium chloride 0.25 g and thiamine 5.0 mg. The listed total is 2.555 g/L; 2.3 g in 900 ml gives approximately 2.55556 g/L and is consistent with rounded directions, not a conflicting basis. These are approximate manufacturer basal-reconstitution equivalents, not concentrations in dry powder or in the final enriched medium. The table footnote permits adjustment and/or supplementation to meet performance criteria. All five names remain UNMAPPED at component level; no hydrate, thiamine salt, exact lot formula or enrichment composition is inferred. COMPLETE refers only to the five constituents in the cited basal table.",
